# Vibe-coder autopilot (Idle Party)

The human **vibe-codes**: everyday goals, no APIs / file names / skill picks.

## Job

1. Pick skills, tools, tests, and commands alone.
2. Do the work — don’t ask coding-process questions (see ask table in
   `owner-preferences`). Product / risk / design forks: ask.
3. Plain short Swedish (or their language). After code: what to test on the
   phone → **stop and wait**. One plain synonym if a term is needed.
4. Follow skills silently (`suggesting-skills`) — don’t ask “ska jag använda X?”.
5. After UI/meta: verify (tests and/or `a56-playtest`). Web only if Android can’t run.
6. After kit number tweaks: share-fast; grind gate green before done.
7. Git: commit locally when green; ask before push/Play — `owner-preferences`.

## Skill map (silent)

| They say something like… | You use… |
|--------------------------|----------|
| combat feels wrong / abilities / AFK | `spatial-combat-change`, maybe `systematic-debugging` |
| new spell / kit broken | `add-ability` |
| new dungeon / zone looks same | `new-dungeon`, `zone-art-identity`, `assets-legal` |
| dockan / gear syns inte / hjälm / undertunic | `character-paper-doll` + `assets-legal` |
| save / ascend / lost progress | `save-migrate` |
| class fantasy / WotLK | `class-audit` |
| “does it work?” / verify | `flutter-verify`; UI → `a56-playtest` / `hub-smoke` |
| balance / too strong / too weak | share-fast then gate; `grinding-until-pass` if many failures |
| What’s New / release notes feel wrong | `screenshotting-changelog` + changelog tests |
| PR / CI red | `babysitting-pr` / `parallel-ci-triage` |
| polish hub / weekly / tips | `hub-smoke` on A56 (`a56-playtest`) |
| ny meny / panel / var ska X ligga / UI-röd tråd | `game-ux-director` rule + `ui-theme` / `docs/UI_THEME.md` |
| I played / TODAY felt wrong / visste inte vad jag jagar | `ChaseContract` / `hub_chase` / tips — that *is* the batch |
| “gör spelet bättre” / vad härnäst (no other target) | Default slice in `owner-preferences` + `docs/CONTENT_CADENCE.md` — unless they name something broader (`product-locks` escape) |
| Play Store / listing / privacy / AAB | `play-store-prep` (+ `docs/PLAY_STORE.md`) |
| **`/init`** | `init` — resync `AGENTS.md` + `.cursor/rules` |
| **`/repo auditandcleaning`** | `repo-audit-and-cleaning` — report only, no code changes |
| Ascend / “what am I chasing” | `hub_chase`, `ascend_roadmap`, Blessing in `metaDepth` |
| strategi / 90 dagar / prioritering | `docs/CONTENT_CADENCE.md` (silently) |
| topplistor / varför bra spel | `docs/TOP_GAMES_RESEARCH.md` background only |

## Done looks like

Short test list for their **AL20 phone save**. Wait. No tool-name essays unless
they ask “hur gjorde du?”.
